      "statement": "Calcula la cantidad de cada reactivo.",
      "modelAnswer": "$n(\\mathrm{Al}) = \\dfrac{2{,}70}{26{,}98} = 0{,}100\\,\\text{mol}$. (1) $n(\\mathrm{Cl_2}) = \\dfrac{7{,}10}{70{,}90} = 0{,}100\\,\\text{mol}$. (1)",
